  "term": "Zugunruhe",
  "definition": "Zugunruhe is migratory restlessness: increased restless activity shown by birds in association with migration, especially noted in captive birds during autumn migration research. In this packet, it is treated as a migratory behavior linked to variation in a candidate gene.",
